<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
        <title>Home Page</title>
        <style>
            body{
                margin: 40px;
            }
            .form_container{
                width: 400px;
                margin: auto;
                padding: 30px;
                border: 1px solid #ccc;
                border-radius: 5px;
                box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
                
            }
            input, select{
                width: 100%;
                padding: 8px;
                margin-top: 5px;
                margin-bottom: 15px;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }
            .gender{
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: row;
                gap: 20px;
                align-items: center;
            }
            .gender label{
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 5px;
            }
            .gender input[type="radio"]{
               width: auto;
               margin: 0;
            }
            button{
                margin:auto;
                padding:10px;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
            
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        <nav class = "navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">

            <div class="container">
                <a class = "navbar-brand" href = "/">Task 3</a>

                <button class = "navbar-toggler" type = "button" data-bs-toggle = "collapse" data-bs-target = "#navbarnav">
                    <span class = "navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>

                <div class = "collapse navbar-collapse" id = "navbarnav">
                    <ul class = "navbar-nav ms-auto">
                        <li class = "nav-item">
                            <a class = "nav-link" href = "#home">Home</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class = "nav-item">
                            <a class = "nav-link" href = "#register">Register</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class = "nav-item">
                            <a class = "nav-link" href = "#details">Details</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </nav>
        <section id="home" class = "task-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class = "row align-items-center">
                    <div class = "col-lg-7 col-md-8">
                        <h1>Task 3</h1>
                        <h2>Advance CSS Styling & Responsive Design</h2>
                         <p>In this task, 
                            we enhance our web application with advanced CSS styling, 
                            responsive design, animations, transitions and Bootstrap.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class = "col-lg-5 col-md-4">
                        <div class = "task-card">
                            <h3>What are we doing?</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Advanced CSS styling</li>
                                <li>CSS transitions</li>
                                <li>CSS animations</li>
                                <li>Responsive design</li>
                                <li>Bootstrap integration</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section id = "register" class = "registration-info">
            <div class="container">
                    <div class = "registration-info-card">
                        <h2>Registration Form</h2>
                        <p>When you register, your form data is sentto the Express server using a POST request.</p>
                        <p>The server validates the submitted data before storing the validated information temporarily on the server.</p>
                        <p>After successful registration, you will be redirected to a response page.</p>
                        <a href = "/register" class = "btn btn-primary">Go To Registration</a>

                    </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section id = "details" class = "details-section">
            <div class = "container">
                <h2 class = "text-center mb-5" >Registration Details</h2>
                <div class = "row g-4">
                    <div class = "col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class = "detail-card">
                            <h3>Name</h3>
                            <p>We collect the User's name during registration.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class = "col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class = "detail-card">
                            <h3>Email</h3>
                            <p>We collect the User's email address during registration.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class = "col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class = "detail-card">
                            <h3>Age</h3>
                            <p>We collect the User's age during registration.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class = "col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class = "detail-card">
                            <h3>Gender</h3>
                            <p>The user can select their Gender.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class = "col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class = "detail-card">
                            <h3>City</h3>
                            <p>The user select there city.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class = "col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class = "detail-card">
                            <h3>Password</h3>
                            <p>A Password is collected for Registration.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>
        <footer class = "footer">
            <div class = "container text-center">
                <h4>Task 3 Project</h4>
                <p>Advanced CSS Styling & Responsive Design</p>
                <a href = "https://github.com/raja-181101/Internship-Tasks" target = "_blank" class = "github-link">GitHub Repository</a>
                <p>© 2026 Task 3 Project. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </body>
</html>